Synthesis structure (11 required sections): Role Overview → Core
Responsibilities (with per-line autonomy tier) → Required Skills (Required vs.
Nice-to-have, with proficiency levels) → Domain Operational Artifacts
(runbooks, eval frameworks, query patterns, templates, references,
